<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ shares close firm, R. Brands debuts strongly.</title>
<headline>NZ shares close firm, R. Brands debuts strongly.</headline>
<text>
<p>* NZ shares close firmer on good volume</p>
<p>* Restaurant Brands ends up 27c on issue price</p>
<p>* Fletcher Energy dives on late Tues drilling report</p>
<p>---------------------------(June 4)---------------------------</p>
<p>Price movements at close</p>
<p>  LAST CHG  * NZSE40 cap index +7.61 at 2,357.03</p>
<p>  135   +1  * NZSE-10 cap index +5.09 at 1,189.21</p>
<p>  352   +4  * NZSC cap index +21.44 at 5,058.76</p>
<p>  340   +4  * NZMC  .NZMC midcap +1.78 at 1,869.85</p>
<p>  369   +6  * Vol $85.6 million, June futures +2 at 1183</p>
<p>  701   +6  * Other movers - -47</p>
</text>
